Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.60,0:01:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,《霍比特人》
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.42,0:12:45.65,Note,,0,0,0,,《五军之战》
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.13,0:14:44.89,Note,,0,0,0,,莱戈拉斯殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.92,0:14:50.27,Note,,0,0,0,,离开那矮人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.43,0:14:53.69,Note,,0,0,0,,你有自己的任务
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.42,0:25:09.89,Note,,0,0,0,,林地精灵
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.30,0:25:14.48,Note,,0,0,0,,精灵国王的儿子和一个女精灵
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.26,0:25:17.02,Note,,0,0,0,,跟踪我们到了长湖镇
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.27,0:25:25.99,Note,,0,0,0,,那你把他们都杀了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.77,0:25:27.87,Note,,0,0,0,,他们像胆小鬼一样
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.02,0:25:29.70,Note,,0,0,0,,尖叫着逃跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.40,0:25:31.83,Note,,0,0,0,,蠢货 他们还会回来的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.03,0:25:35.91,Note,,0,0,0,,到时候会带着精灵军队
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.49,0:25:41.34,Note,,0,0,0,,速去冈达巴
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.95,0:25:45.88,Note,,0,0,0,,让各军团出动
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.75,0:25:51.85,Note,,0,0,0,,精灵
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.80,0:25:54.43,Note,,0,0,0,,人类
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.47,0:25:55.93,Note,,0,0,0,,矮人
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.30,0:25:58.48,Note,,0,0,0,,孤山将会是他们的坟墓
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.77,0:26:01.11,Note,,0,0,0,,开战
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.21,0:26:31.35,Note,,0,0,0,,莱格拉斯殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.59,0:26:33.72,Note,,0,0,0,,我带来了您父王的口信
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.92,0:26:36.60,Note,,0,0,0,,他让您立即返回
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.01,0:26:38.27,Note,,0,0,0,,走吧 塔瑞尔
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.34,0:26:39.69,Note,,0,0,0,,殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.89,0:26:42.27,Note,,0,0,0,,塔瑞尔被放逐了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.97,0:26:44.02,Note,,0,0,0,,放逐
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.69,0:26:59.00,Note,,0,0,0,,没错 他是我的国王
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.78,0:27:01.54,Note,,0,0,0,,但他的命令不能主宰我
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.05,0:28:09.19,Note,,0,0,0,,念咒语救不了你的 老东西
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.77,0:28:13.03,Note,,0,0,0,,你身上有我主人要的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.48,0:28:14.74,Note,,0,0,0,,它在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.73,0:28:18.79,Note,,0,0,0,,精灵三戒之一的
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.58,0:28:32.55,Note,,0,0,0,,火之戒纳亚
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.62,0:28:33.72,Note,,0,0,0,,其它两枚在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.91,0:29:53.80,Note,,0,0,0,,三枚戒指给了天空之下的精灵国王们
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.29,0:29:59.80,Note,,0,0,0,,七枚戒指给了石厅里的矮人国王
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.03,0:30:31.75,Note,,0,0,0,,你无法和影子战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.08,0:30:34.96,Note,,0,0,0,,更何况你很虚弱
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.46,0:30:36.80,Note,,0,0,0,,独自一人
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.58,0:30:39.63,Note,,0,0,0,,孤掌难鸣
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.47,0:33:43.57,Note,,0,0,0,,已经开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.93,0:33:46.45,Note,,0,0,0,,东方将会陨落
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.69,0:33:50.28,Note,,0,0,0,,安格玛王国将会崛起
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.15,0:33:55.83,Note,,0,0,0,,精灵的时代已经结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.40,0:33:59.50,Note,,0,0,0,,半兽人的时代即将来临
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.01,0:34:59.89,Note,,0,0,0,,我们被欺骗了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.05,0:58:35.73,Note,,0,0,0,,我们的军队将在黎明前完成布署
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.84,0:58:39.31,Note,,0,0,0,,会打得他们措手不及
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.55,0:58:41.27,Note,,0,0,0,,那些蠢货
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.56,0:58:45.86,Note,,0,0,0,,早就忘记这片土地下的生物
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.02,0:58:52.33,Note,,0,0,0,,忘记巨型地蛇的存在
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.66,0:59:06.26,Note,,0,0,0,,如果要进去  现在就该行动了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.84,0:59:19.77,Note,,0,0,0,,它们蜂拥而出
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.60,1:00:12.78,Note,,0,0,0,,必须警告其他人
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.10,1:00:15.37,Note,,0,0,0,,也许晚了  快走
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.66,1:17:50.34,Note,,0,0,0,,前进吧 我的大军
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.89,1:19:41.41,Note,,0,0,0,,派出战争野兽
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.00,1:20:07.52,Note,,0,0,0,,破坏他们的战争机器
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.62,1:20:38.92,Note,,0,0,0,,他们无法双线作战
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.04,1:20:43.09,Note,,0,0,0,,现在我们开始行动
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.84,1:20:47.47,Note,,0,0,0,,进攻河谷镇
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.99,1:27:29.54,Note,,0,0,0,,他们守不住这座城
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.70,1:27:34.00,Note,,0,0,0,,矮人也快完蛋了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.77,1:28:08.08,Note,,0,0,0,,让这里血流成河
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.20,1:28:12.58,Note,,0,0,0,,全部杀光
Dialogue: 0,1:33:17.88,1:33:21.43,Note,,0,0,0,,他们的死期到了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:22.63,1:33:25.36,Note,,0,0,0,,准备发起最后的进攻
Dialogue: 0,1:35:24.21,1:35:27.69,Note,,0,0,0,,还不到时候 等等 等等
Dialogue: 0,1:35:34.89,1:35:36.69,Note,,0,0,0,,现在 进攻
Dialogue: 0,1:51:45.99,1:51:47.91,Note,,0,0,0,,你不能离开
Dialogue: 0,1:52:44.42,1:52:45.93,Note,,0,0,0,,如果你要伤害她
Dialogue: 0,1:52:46.51,1:52:48.14,Note,,0,0,0,,那你要先杀了我
Dialogue: 0,1:55:26.16,1:55:28.09,Note,,0,0,0,,这个最先死
Dialogue: 0,1:55:28.96,1:55:31.35,Note,,0,0,0,,然后是他的兄弟
Dialogue: 0,1:55:32.25,1:55:35.31,Note,,0,0,0,,接着是你 橡木盾
Dialogue: 0,1:55:36.34,1:55:38.36,Note,,0,0,0,,你是最后一个
Dialogue: 0,1:55:51.73,1:55:53.45,Note,,0,0,0,,你的血脉就此终结
Dialogue: 0,1:57:40.47,1:57:41.68,Note,,0,0,0,,全部杀光
Dialogue: 0,1:59:44.71,1:59:47.27,Note,,0,0,0,,去杀了他
Dialogue: 0,1:59:51.60,1:59:53.94,Note,,0,0,0,,干掉他
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.35,0:13:14.51,Note,,0,0,0,,如果需要帮助 我一定会出现
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.63,0:14:26.11,Note,,0,0,0,,我爱你
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.29,0:27:38.36,Note,,0,0,0,,万能的维拉 救救他吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.70,0:27:43.06,Note,,0,0,0,,救救他吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.17,0:28:58.58,Note,,0,0,0,,这是我主人的地盘
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.37,0:29:02.79,Note,,0,0,0,,你死到临头了 巫师
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.09,0:27:45.92,Note,,0,0,0,,请听我说 解除他身上的咒语
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.05,0:27:48.93,Note,,0,0,0,,解除他身上的咒语 不要让他死去
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.15,0:27:52.05,Note,,0,0,0,,解除他身上的咒语 不要让他死去
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.17,0:27:55.33,Note,,0,0,0,,解除他身上的咒语 不要让他死去
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.88,1:12:50.34,Note,,0,0,0,,铜墙铁壁阵
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.61,1:18:58.69,Note,,0,0,0,,让他们去死吧
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.26,1:19:33.67,Note,,0,0,0,,挡我者死
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.47,1:19:54.27,Note,,0,0,0,,布好阵型
Dialogue: 0,1:36:26.22,1:36:29.47,Note,,0,0,0,,冲啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.52,0:01:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我警告过你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I warned you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.81,0:01:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,和矮人打交道不会有好下场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did I not warn you what would come of dealing with Dwarves?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.98,0:01:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,现在他们做了蠢事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now they've done it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.01,0:01:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,弄醒了恶龙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've woken the dragon!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.38,0:01:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,厄运就要降临到我们头上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've brought an apocalypse upon our heads!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.89,0:01:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 搞快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Quickly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.37,0:01:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quickly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.48,0:01:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,再快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Faster now...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.36,0:01:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我正忙着要撤离\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I'm trying to evacuate myself here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.48,0:01:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,小心点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Careful, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.60,0:01:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,别管那些书了 把剩下的都搬走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never mind the books. Get on, get the rest of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.70,0:01:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,但镇长 难道我们不该想办法救小镇吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But, sire, should we not try to save the town?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.95,0:01:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,小镇救不了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The town is lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.27,0:01:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- 黄金要紧 - 你们都听见了 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Save the gold! - You heard him. Get a move on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.64,0:01:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- 爸爸 - 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Da! - Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.24,0:01:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,尽量堆高\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pile them up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.38,0:01:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,没有时间了 我们必须走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have no time. We must leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.50,0:01:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- 把他扶起来 - 快点 弟弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get him up. - Come on, brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.90,0:02:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快 快 我们走 - 我没事 自己能走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on. Come on. Let's go. - I'm fine. I can walk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.13,0:02:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- 尽可能跑快点 - 我们不走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Fast as you can. - We're not leaving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.69,0:02:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,不能丢下爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not without our father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.01,0:02:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你留在这里 你妹妹必死无疑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you stay here, your sisters will die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.77,0:02:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你父亲不会希望这种事发生吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that what your father would want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.84,0:02:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,快把门打开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open this door!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.80,0:02:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,有人听见吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you hear me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.72,0:02:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我能看见它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can see him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.37,0:02:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.00,0:02:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,下面来 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Down here! Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.86,0:02:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- 把手给我 - 快点 我们得走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Give me your hand. - Come on. We gotta go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.16,0:02:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 赶快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quickly now. Hurry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.89,0:02:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,奇力 快来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kili, come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.30,0:02:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- 就在前面转角 - 继续前进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's around the corner! - Keep on going, man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.85,0:02:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,,恶龙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dragon!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.28,0:03:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,快 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.47,0:03:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,划快点 再快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Faster! Faster!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.96,0:03:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,要是能多载些人就好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If only we could take more of these people with us,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.91,0:03:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,但他们的命…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but they're hardly...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.76,0:03:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不值钱 我非常赞同 - 救命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Worth it. I quite agree. - Help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.01,0:03:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,救命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.10,0:03:45.11,Default,,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.65,0:03:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,快划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.42,0:03:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,快划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.86,0:03:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 再快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! Faster!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.81,0:03:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我的金子 金子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My gold! My gold!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.65,0:03:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,船承载不了这么多重量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're carrying too much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.36,0:04:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,必须丢掉一些东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to dump something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.28,0:04:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,说得对 阿尔弗雷德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quite right, Alfrid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.64,0:04:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,快 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Faster! Faster!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.57,0:05:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,可怜的人们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Poor souls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.97,0:07:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Da.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.56,0:07:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Da!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.85,0:07:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,他射中了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He hit it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.85,0:07:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他射中恶龙了 - 没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He hit the dragon! - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.65,0:07:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,他射中了 射出了划痕 我看见了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He did! He hit his mark! I saw.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.94,0:07:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,他的箭射不穿龙鳞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His arrows cannot pierce its hide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.91,0:07:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,恐怕那龙坚不可摧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I fear nothing will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.07,0:07:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你要做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.17,0:07:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快回来 贝恩 - 贝恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come back! Bain! - Bain!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.22,0:07:46.05,Default,,0,0,0,,贝恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bain!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.59,0:07:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,快回到这里来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get back here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.50,0:07:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 贝恩 - 让他去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Bain! - Leave him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.60,0:07:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不能回去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We cannot go back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.54,0:07:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,贝恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bain!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.44,0:08:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.42,0:08:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,贝恩 你来做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bain! What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.76,0:08:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该离开的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why didn't you leave, you were supposed to leave!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.65,0:08:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我来帮助你 - 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I came to help you. - No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.44,0:08:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,没什么能阻挡它了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing can stop it now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.43,0:08:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,也许这个可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This might.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.30,0:08:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,贝恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.40,0:08:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你快回去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You go back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.20,0:08:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,快点离开这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You get out of here. Now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.60,0:08:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.54,0:08:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.30,0:08:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.63,0:08:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,停 停 不要动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop, stop! Halt!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.89,0:08:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,别动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Halt!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.79,0:09:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.72,0:09:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,那么大胆 竟敢来阻挡我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...that would stand against me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.75,0:09:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,真是遗憾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, that is a pity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.20,0:09:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,现在你该怎么办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What will you do now...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.50,0:09:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,弓箭手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...Bowman?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.03,0:09:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你被抛弃了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are forsaken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.81,0:09:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,没人会来帮助你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No help will come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.63,0:09:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,机会来了 快逃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now's our chance! Go fled!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.17,0:09:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,快逃到空旷的水域\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Head for the open water!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.57,0:09:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hmm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.09,0:09:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,那是你的孩子吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that your child?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.16,0:09:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你无法从烈焰中救出他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You cannot save him from the fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.30,0:09:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我要把他烧焦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He will burn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.02,0:10:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,不要动 儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay still, son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.05,0:10:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,稳住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay still.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.44,0:10:18.47,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.35,0:10:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,可怜的贱民\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...wretch...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.91,0:10:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在要怎么挑战我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...how now shall you challenge me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.47,0:10:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你面前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have nothing left...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.93,0:10:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,只有死路一条\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but your death!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.60,0:10:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,贝恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.82,0:10:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,看着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.69,0:10:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,看着我就好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You look at me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.01,0:10:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,往左移一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Little to your left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.54,0:10:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.99,0:11:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,贝恩 抓紧了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bain! Hold on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.06,0:11:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,那是怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.36,0:11:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- 发生了什么事 - 它掉下去了 我看见了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What happened? - It fell. I saw it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.25,0:12:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,它死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.48,0:12:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,史矛革死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smaug is dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.51,0:12:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我以胡子保证 他说对了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By my beard... I think he's right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.10,0:12:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,快看那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.41,0:12:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,埃尔波尔的渡鸦飞回山里来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Ravens of Erebor are returning to the Mountain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.47,0:12:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.46,0:12:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,消息很快就会传开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Word will spread.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.97,0:12:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,用不了多久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Before long...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.26,0:12:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,中土的人都会知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...every soul in Middle-earth will know...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.22,0:12:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,恶龙死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...the dragon is dead!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.06,0:13:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你并不孤单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are not alone...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.41,0:13:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,米斯兰达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...Mithrandir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.34,0:13:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,救我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.41,0:13:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我的孩子在哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's my baby?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.10,0:13:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.06,0:13:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,快来人救救我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody help me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.62,0:13:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,救命啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.17,0:13:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,在那\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Over there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.80,0:13:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Da!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.64,0:13:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Da!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.57,0:13:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- 爸爸 - 爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Da! - Da!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.89,0:13:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 为什么是我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aah! Why me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.39,0:14:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,塔瑞尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tauriel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.09,0:14:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,奇力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kili!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.65,0:14:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,快过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.69,0:14:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're leaving!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.95,0:14:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是你的同胞 你得走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They are your people. You must go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.95,0:14:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我一起走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.49,0:14:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道我的感受 我不在乎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know how I feel. I'm not afraid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.97,0:14:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你让我感觉生气蓬勃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You make me feel alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.86,0:14:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我不能 - 塔瑞尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I can't. - Tauriel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.86,0:14:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道那是什么意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know what that means.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.27,0:14:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我想你知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.68,0:15:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,再试一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One more!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.88,0:15:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,拿着它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.05,0:15:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,当做信物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As a promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.81,0:15:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,这有干毯子 你会需要的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These are dry. You'll need them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.86,0:15:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谢谢你 - 给\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thank you. - Here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.82,0:15:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 给我拿一件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oi! Give me one of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.78,0:15:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,不然我会被冻死的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll catch my death in this cold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.57,0:16:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你自己去找\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find your own!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.15,0:16:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,现在不是你说了算 马屁精阿尔弗雷德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not in charge, Alfrid Lickspittle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.28,0:16:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,这你就说错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.80,0:16:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,当镇长不在的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the absence of the Master...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.25,0:16:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,由镇长的副手 也就是本人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...the power cedes to his deputy...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.94,0:16:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,代替他行使权利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...which in this instance is my good self.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.16,0:16:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,把毯子给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now give me that blanket!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.33,0:16:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,镇长的副手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Master's deputy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.85,0:16:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,别不要脸了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't make me laugh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.09,0:16:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你就是个窃贼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a sneak-thief.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.93,0:16:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,打死我也不会听你这种人的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be dead before I answer to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.32,0:16:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,那就别怪我不客气了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe that can be arranged.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.33,0:16:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,要我就不会在这里胡闹 阿尔弗雷德 尤其是现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wouldn't go turning on your own, Alfrid. Not now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.20,0:16:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- 爸 - 快过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Da! - Come here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.47,0:16:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.38,0:16:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,没事了 宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all right, darling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.59,0:16:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,是巴德 是他杀了恶龙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was Bard! He killed the dragon!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.09,0:16:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我亲眼看见的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw it with me own eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.20,0:16:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,他把那个畜生杀死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He brought the beast down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.90,0:16:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,用一支黑箭射死的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shot him dead with a Black Arrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.65,0:16:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你 巴德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Bard!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.45,0:17:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好样的 - 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good man. - Thank you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.94,0:17:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你救了我们所有人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've saved us all!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.34,0:17:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,上天保佑你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bless you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.78,0:17:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,向屠龙者致敬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All hail to the Dragon-Slayer!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.73,0:17:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,向国王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All hail...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.18,0:17:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,巴德致敬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...King Bard!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.89,0:17:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我说过很多次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have said it many times.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.98,0:17:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,他出生贵族世家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a man of noble stock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.79,0:17:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- 天生的领袖 - 不要那样叫我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- A born leader! - Do not call me that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.26,0:17:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是长湖镇镇长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not Master of this town.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.11,0:17:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,他在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.37,0:17:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- 镇长在哪里 - 之前在去安都因河的路上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where's the Master? - Halfway down the Anduin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.25,0:17:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,带着我们所有的财宝 毫无疑问\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With all our coin, I don't doubt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.91,0:17:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你肯定知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You would know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.05,0:17:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,是你帮他搬运的财宝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You helped him empty the treasury.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.07,0:17:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.62,0:17:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我试图拦住他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I tried to stop him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.61,0:17:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 骗子 - 小偷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Liar! - Cheat!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.70,0:17:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你个狗杂种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a mongrel!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.82,0:17:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我恳请他 哀求他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I begged. I pleaded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.00,0:17:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,放逐他吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Away with him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.80,0:17:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- 烧死他 - 我说 "镇长"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Tar him! - I said, "Master"...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.61,0:17:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,"这样不对"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}..."No"!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.72,0:17:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,"为孩子们想想"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Think of the children."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.64,0:18:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,绞死他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hang him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.17,0:18:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,"你们都不为孩子想想吗"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Will nobody think of the children?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.84,0:18:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,嗷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ow!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.73,0:18:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,把他挂在树上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To the tree with him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.48,0:18:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- 绞死他 - 把他带走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hang him hard! - Take him down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.33,0:18:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,够了 放开他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enough! Let him go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.30,0:18:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,放开他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let him go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.95,0:18:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,看看你们周围\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look around you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.78,0:18:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,难道你们 还嫌死得人不够多吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you not had your fill of death?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.20,0:18:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,凛冬将至\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Winter is upon us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.75,0:18:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不仅要照顾自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must look to our own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.16,0:18:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,还有病人和无家可归的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To the sick and the helpless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.29,0:18:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,还能走动的人去照料伤者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those who can stand, tend to the wounded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.80,0:18:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,力气大的人跟我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those who have strength, follow me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.25,0:18:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须尽最大努力抢救\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must salvage what we can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.84,0:18:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,然后怎么办 之后我们做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What then? What'll we do then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.17,0:18:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,寻找庇护所\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We find shelter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.00,0:19:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,有人吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.19,0:19:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,邦博\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bombur?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.67,0:19:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,波佛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bofur?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.21,0:19:47.07,Default,,0,0,0,,有人吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anybody?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.16,0:19:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.01,0:19:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.98,0:19:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是比尔博 - 他还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's Bilbo! - He's alive!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.49,0:20:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,停 停下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop! Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.89,0:20:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,停下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.64,0:20:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你们必须离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need to leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.08,0:20:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都得离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We all need to leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.97,0:20:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我们才刚到这里来呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We only just got here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.29,0:20:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟他说过 但他不听劝告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've tried talking, but he won't listen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.26,0:20:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你这话什么意思 伙计 - 是索林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What do you mean, laddie? - Thorin!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.59,0:20:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,索林 索林 他下去有几天了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thorin. Thorin. He's been down there for days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.49,0:20:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,不睡觉 不吃饭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He doesn't sleep. He barely eats.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.69,0:20:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,他都快变了一个人 这还不算什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not been himself. Not at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.18,0:20:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,这个地方这个地方 我觉得有种邪气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's this... It's this place. Ahem. I think a sickness lies on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.94,0:20:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,邪气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sickness?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.94,0:20:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,哪种邪气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What kind of sickness?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.87,0:20:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,菲力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fili.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.20,0:20:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,菲力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fili!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.83,0:20:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,菲力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fili!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.45,0:21:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,黄金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.10,0:21:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,数之不尽的黄金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gold beyond measure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.40,0:21:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,没有痛苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beyond sorrow...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.04,0:21:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,没有哀伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and grief.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.26,0:21:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,请看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Behold...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.21,0:21:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,伟大的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...the great...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.41,0:21:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,索尔留下的巨大宝藏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...treasure hoard of Thror.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.71,0:21:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.36,0:21:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我的外甥们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...my sister-sons...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.22,0:21:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,来到埃尔波尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...to the Kingdom...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.93,0:21:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,王国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...of Erebor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.18,0:21:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,巴林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Balin!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.77,0:21:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,奇力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kili!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.38,0:22:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,感谢都灵 你们还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank Durin, you're alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.29,0:22:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,庞博\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bombur!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.25,0:22:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're alive!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.27,0:22:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- 有什么发现吗 - 这边没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Any sign of it? - Nothing yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.83,0:22:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,这边也没用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.12,0:22:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- 继续找 - 宝石可能会在任何地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Keep searching! - That jewel could be anywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.81,0:22:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,阿肯宝石肯定还在这里面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Arkenstone is in these halls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.01,0:22:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- 找到它 - 你听到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Find it! - You heard him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.62,0:22:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快找 - 都去找\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Keep looking. - All of you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.90,0:22:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,找到之前不许休息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one rests until it is found.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.01,0:22:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我差点都想让你拿走宝石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am almost tempted to let you take it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.27,0:23:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,只为了能看到橡木盾饱受其折磨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If only to see Oakenshield suffer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.57,0:23:07.05,Default,,0,0,0,,看着宝石摧毁他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch it destroy him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.84,0:23:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,看着钻石腐蚀他的心智\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch it corrupt his heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.11,0:23:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,让他疯掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and drive him mad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.13,0:23:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我来帮你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.79,0:23:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,只带必需品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take only what you need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.28,0:23:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还有很远的路要走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have a long march ahead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.02,0:23:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你们要到哪去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where will you go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.56,0:23:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,只有一个地方可去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is only one place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.00,0:24:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,孤山\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Mountain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.84,0:24:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你可真英明 大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are a genius, sire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.97,0:24:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可以在山里避难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can take refuge inside the Mountain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.61,0:24:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然会有恶龙的气味 但女人们可以打扫干净\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It might smell a bit of dragon, but the women can clean that up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.25,0:24:13.53,Default,,0,0,0,,那里将会很安全 暖和 干燥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It'll be safe and warm and dry...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.83,0:24:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,物资丰富\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and full of stores...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.53,0:24:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,有床和衣物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...bedding, clothing...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.14,0:24:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,还有一些黄金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...the odd bit of gold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.53,0:24:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,山里的黄金都被诅咒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What gold is in that Mountain is cursed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.44,0:24:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只取应得的那份\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We will take only what was promised to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.48,0:24:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,只拿用来重建家园和维持生活的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only what we need to rebuild our lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.03,0:24:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,来 你再多拿点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here. Pull your weight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.92,0:24:36.05,Default,,0,0,0,,史矛革的死讯很快会传遍整片大陆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}News of the death of Smaug will have spread through the lands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.05,0:24:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.80,0:24:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,会有人觊觎孤山的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Others will now look to the Mountain...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.85,0:24:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,财富\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...for its wealth...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.89,0:24:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,以及它的有利地形\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...for its position.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.38,0:24:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你还知道什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.95,0:24:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,都不确定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing for certain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.91,0:24:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,都是我的猜测\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's what I fear may come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.70,0:26:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你在那边看见什么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You saw something out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.26,0:26:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,追到长湖镇的半兽人军团 我知道是谁了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Orc I pursued out of Lake-town, I know who he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.58,0:26:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,博尔格 毁灭者阿索格的儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bolg, spawn of Azog the Defiler.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.06,0:26:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,一群座狼在长湖镇外等着他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A Warg pack was waiting for him on the outskirts of Esgaroth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.90,0:26:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,他们逃往北方去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They fled into the North.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.15,0:26:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,这些半兽人和其他以前的不一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These Orcs were different from the others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.64,0:26:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,他们的标记 我已经很久没有看到过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They bore a mark I have not seen for a long time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.80,0:26:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,冈达巴的标记\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The mark of Gundabad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.54,0:26:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,冈达巴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gundabad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.02,0:26:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,远离迷雾山脉北方的一个半兽人大本营\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An Orc stronghold in the far North of the Misty Mountains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.70,0:26:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你回去告诉我父王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You may tell my father...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.06,0:26:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,如果不让塔瑞尔回去 我也不回去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...if there is no place for Tauriel, there is no place for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.74,0:26:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,莱戈拉斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Legolas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.04,0:26:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,这是你父王的命令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is your king's command.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.48,0:27:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我要去北方 你和我一起来吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I ride North. Will you come with me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.95,0:27:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,到哪里去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To where?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.21,0:27:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,冈达巴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To Gundabad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.17,0:29:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我为了米斯兰达而来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I come for mithrandir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.04,0:29:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,而且我要带走他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I will leave with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.91,0:29:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你胆敢碍事 我就灭了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you try to stop me, I will destroy you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.45,0:30:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,九枚戒指\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nine...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.96,0:30:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,给了注定死亡的人类\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...for mortal Men doomed to die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.34,0:30:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是独自一人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am not alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.92,0:30:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,夫人 需要帮忙吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you in need of assistance, my lady?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.64,0:31:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你该乖乖长眠地下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should've stayed dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.09,0:31:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,米斯兰达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mithrandir...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.37,0:31:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,醒醒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...come back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.05,0:32:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,他在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.70,0:32:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.40,0:32:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,黑暗已经再度降临了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The darkness has returned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.41,0:32:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.54,0:32:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,甘道夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gandalf!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.28,0:32:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,甘道夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gandalf!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.40,0:32:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,快上车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Climb on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.99,0:32:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,他很虚弱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is weak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.27,0:32:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,不能呆在这里了 这里会消耗他的生命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He cannot remain here. It is draining his life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.10,0:32:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.80,0:32:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quickly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.42,0:32:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,和我一起走 夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come with me, my lady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.10,0:32:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.72,0:34:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,轮不到你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have no...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.39,0:34:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,在这放肆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...power here...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.22,0:34:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,魔苟斯之仆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...servant of Morgoth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.52,0:34:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你只是无名鼠辈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are nameless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.32,0:34:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,无脸无形\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Faceless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.05,0:34:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,行尸走肉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Formless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.19,0:34:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,滚回太虚中去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go back to the void...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.10,0:34:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,那是你本该待的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...from whence you came!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.83,0:35:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,索伦依旧阴魂不散\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The spirit of Sauron endured.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.73,0:35:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,他已经被驱逐了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And has been banished.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.56,0:35:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,他会逃往东方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He will flee into the East.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.17,0:35:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,必须给刚铎发去警告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gondor should be warned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.52,0:35:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,他们肯定监视着魔多的动静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They must set a watch on the walls of Mordor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.98,0:35:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.92,0:35:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,照顾好凯兰崔尔夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look after the Lady Galadriel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.09,0:35:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,她耗费了太多的力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She has spent much of her power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.53,0:35:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,快撑不住了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Her strength is failing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.74,0:35:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,带她到罗斯洛立安城\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take her to Lothlórien.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.57,0:35:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,萨鲁曼大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My Lord Saruman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.15,0:35:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须乘胜追击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He must be hunted down...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.29,0:35:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,摧毁他 不留后患\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and destroyed once and for all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.78,0:35:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,没有那枚指环的力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Without the Ring of Power...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.05,0:35:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,索伦就永远没法卷土重来 染指中土\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...Sauron can never again hold dominion over Middle-earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.72,0:35:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你们快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.64,0:35:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,索伦的事交给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave Sauron to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.05,0:35:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我要一匹马 - 什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I need a horse. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.06,0:35:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,甘道夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gandalf...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.89,0:35:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你要到哪里去 - 警告埃尔波尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...where are you going? - To warn Erebor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.32,0:36:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,他们不清楚将要到发生的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They have no idea what is coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.22,0:36:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我亲眼看见成千上万的莫瑞亚半兽人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw them with my own eyes, rank upon rank of Moria Orcs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.93,0:36:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你得去召集我们的朋友 鹰王和人熊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must summon our friends, bird and beast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.69,0:36:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,孤山大战就要来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The battle for the Mountain is about to begin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.00,0:36:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.97,0:36:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,拿上这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.58,0:36:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你说的是真的 那么你比我更需要这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If what you say is true, then you'll need it more than I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.25,0:36:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.23,0:36:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,提醒你一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A word of warning, eh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.60,0:36:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,这玩意有时候不太灵敏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It can be a bit dicky sometimes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.98,0:36:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,到时候你只需要拧一拧杖头就好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You just have to twiddle with the top.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.42,0:36:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我想你知道怎样做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I expect you'll manage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.70,0:36:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,它就在这些大厅里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is here in these halls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.04,0:36:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我很确定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.21,0:36:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我们四处都找过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have searched and searched.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.99,0:36:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,还不够\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not well enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.07,0:36:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,索林 我们都很想找回宝石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thorin, we all would see the stone returned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.95,0:36:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,但是就是找不到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And yet, it is still not found!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.80,0:37:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你是在怀疑我们对你的的忠诚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you doubt the loyalty of anyone here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.53,0:37:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,阿肯宝石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Arkenstone...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.17,0:37:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,是我族人的传承之宝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...is the birthright of our people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.02,0:37:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,它是国王的宝石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is The King's Jewel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.34,0:37:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,难道我不是国王吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Am I not the king?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.18,0:37:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,听好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Know this:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.17,0:37:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,如果有谁找到宝石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If anyone should find it...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.27,0:37:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,却私藏起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and withhold it from me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.00,0:37:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我必将严惩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I will be avenged.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.54,0:38:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,恶龙附体了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dragon-sickness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.50,0:38:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我之前见过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've seen it before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.10,0:38:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,那种表情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.12,0:38:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,过度的欲望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The terrible need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.08,0:38:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,对财宝强烈而病态的追求 比尔博\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is a fierce and jealous love, Bilbo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.93,0:38:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,曾经把他的祖父逼疯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It sent his grandfather mad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.62,0:38:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,巴林 如果索林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Balin, if Thorin...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.56,0:38:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,得到了阿肯宝石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...had the Arkenstone...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.04,0:38:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说如果找到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...or if it was found...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.19,0:38:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,会对他有帮助吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...would it help?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.27,0:38:45.73,Default,,0,0,0,,那个宝石象征着皇权\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That stone crowns all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.14,0:38:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,谁握有宝石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is the summit of this great wealth...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.30,0:38:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,就能掌控大权和所有财富\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...bestowing power upon he who bears it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.81,0:38:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,他会就此打住吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would it stay his madness?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.38,0:38:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,不 孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, laddie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.87,0:39:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,恐怕他会变得更糟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I fear it would make him worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.41,0:39:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,也许这宝石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps it is best...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.21,0:39:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,还是别被找到的好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...it remains lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.73,0:39:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.55,0:39:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你手里的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In your hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.17,0:39:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,没什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.60,0:39:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,给我看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Show me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.46,0:39:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,这是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.68,0:39:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我在比翁的花园里捡的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I picked it up in Beorn's garden.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.32,0:39:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你这一路一直带着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've carried it all this way?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.45,0:39:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我要把它种在我的花园里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna plant it in my garden.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.38,0:39:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,袋底洞边上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In Bag End.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.70,0:39:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,这作为带回夏尔的战利品也太不起眼了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a poor prize to take back to the Shire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.62,0:40:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,有一天它会长大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One day, it'll grow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.84,0:40:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,每当我看到它 就会想起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And every time I look at it, I'll remember.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.55,0:40:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,想起所有发生过的事 好的 不好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember everything that happened, the good, the bad...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.26,0:40:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,还有多幸运能活着回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and how lucky I am that I made it home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.60,0:40:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,索林 我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thorin, I...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.39,0:40:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,索林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thorin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.83,0:40:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,长湖镇的幸存者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Survivors from Lake-town...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.53,0:40:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,都在涌向河谷镇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...they're streaming into Dale.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.96,0:40:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,数以百计的难民\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's hundreds of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.24,0:40:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,叫所有人到大门处集合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Call everyone to the gate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.47,0:40:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,到大门那\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To the gate!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.78,0:40:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,立刻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.79,0:41:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.12,0:41:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- 继续走 - 大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Keep moving. - Sire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.10,0:41:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.95,0:41:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,快上来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Up here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.00,0:41:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,大人快看 火盆点起来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, sire! The braziers are lit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.56,0:41:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,看来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.96,0:41:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,索林·橡木盾他们还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...the Company of Thorin Oakenshield survived.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.90,0:41:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Survived?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.88,0:41:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你是说那群矮人和满屋的黄金在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mean there's a bunch of Dwarves with all that gold?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.77,0:41:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,不用担心 阿尔弗雷德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I shouldn't worry, Alfrid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.00,0:41:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,孤山里的黄金多得很\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's gold enough in that Mountain for all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.65,0:41:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,今晚在这里过夜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make camp here tonight!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.66,0:41:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,自己去找留宿的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find what shelter you can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.44,0:41:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,升几堆火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get some fires going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.14,0:41:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快点 快去 - 阿尔弗雷德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on, hurry along now. - Alfrid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.00,0:41:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你今晚负责守夜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll take the night watch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.85,0:42:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,堆上去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Up it goes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.76,0:42:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.19,0:42:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我要堡垒在天亮之前堆好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want this fortress made safe by sunup.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.59,0:42:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,夺回孤山实属不易\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This Mountain was hard-won.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.42,0:42:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会让它再次被夺走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will not see it taken again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.33,0:42:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,长湖镇的难民一无所有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The people of Lake-town have nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.07,0:42:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,他们前来求助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They came to us in need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.50,0:42:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,他们失去了一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They have lost everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.92,0:42:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,不要告诉我他们失去了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do not tell me what they have lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.16,0:42:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我理解他们的艰难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know well enough their hardship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.94,0:42:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,那些在恶龙之火中活下来的人应该值得庆幸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those who have lived through dragon fire should rejoice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.16,0:42:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,他们应该心存感激\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They have much to be grateful for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.66,0:42:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,多弄点石头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}More stone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.70,0:42:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,门口的石头再多点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring more stone to the gate!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.73,0:42:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,就这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.43,0:43:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- 孩子们正挨着饿 - 我们需要食物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- These children are starving. - We need food.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.34,0:43:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们最多坚持三天 - 巴德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We won't last three days. - Bard...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.62,0:43:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们物资匮乏 - 尽你所能 珀西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...we don't have enough. - Do what you can, Percy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.52,0:43:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没事的 - 不要担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It'll be all right. - Don't worry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.03,0:43:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要更多的水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need more water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.04,0:43:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,孩子 受伤的人还有妇女先过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The children, the wounded and the women come first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.58,0:43:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,给\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.87,0:43:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,早上好 阿尔弗雷德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good morning, Alfrid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.74,0:43:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,夜里有没有什么动静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What news from the night watch?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.42,0:43:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,很安静 大人 没什么可汇报的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All quiet, sire. Not much to report.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.50,0:43:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,连鬼影都没来过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing gets past me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.46,0:43:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,除了一支精灵军队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Except an army of Elves, it would seem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.13,0:44:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,瑟兰迪尔陛下 没想到您\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My Lord Thranduil, we did not look...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.66,0:44:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- 会大驾光临 - 听说你需要帮助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...to see you here. - I heard you needed aid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.79,0:44:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,接着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.23,0:45:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,向后传\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pass it back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.03,0:45:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,这还有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Another one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.86,0:45:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你救了我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have saved us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.98,0:45:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我都不知道怎么报答你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do not know how to thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.45,0:45:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你不需要感激\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your gratitude is misplaced.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.87,0:45:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是专为你们而来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did not come on your behalf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.69,0:45:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我是来取回属于我的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I came to reclaim something of mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.93,0:45:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,那山里也有我想要的宝石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are gems in the Mountain that I, too, desire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.44,0:45:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,散发着纯白星光的珠宝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}White gems of pure starlight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.17,0:45:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,绿叶森林的白宝石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The White Gems of Lasgalen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.52,0:45:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道有位精灵王愿出高价交换这些宝石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know an Elf Lord who will pay a pretty price for these.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.32,0:45:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 请等一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait! Please wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.53,0:45:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,为了一些宝石你就要去打仗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You would go to war over a handful of gems?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.19,0:45:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我们族人的国宝岂能容他人占有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The heirlooms of my people are not lightly forsaken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.08,0:46:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,这点咱们在同一战线上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are allies in this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.20,0:46:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,山里的财宝 我们的人也应得一份\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My People also have a claim upon the riches in that Mountain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.80,0:46:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,让我去和索林谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me speak with Thorin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.17,0:46:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你想和矮人讲道理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You would try to reason with the Dwarf?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.87,0:46:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,为了避免挑起战争\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To avoid war?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.10,0:46:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.87,0:46:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,辛苦了一晚 做得不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not a bad night's work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.84,0:46:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,都过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.88,0:46:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,索恩之子 索林万岁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hail, Thorin, son of Thrain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.75,0:46:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,看到你们还活着 我们很高兴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are glad to find you alive beyond hope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.56,0:46:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你为何带着军队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do you come to the gates...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.84,0:46:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,来城门下讨敌叫阵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...of the King under the Mountain armed for war?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.97,0:46:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,那为何孤山国王躲在城墙后面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why does the King under the Mountain fence himself in...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.50,0:47:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,像个缩在洞里的强盗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...like a robber in his hold?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.47,0:47:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,或许是因为我担心有人来抢劫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps it is because I am expecting to be robbed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.68,0:47:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,国王陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My lord...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.54,0:47:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不会抢劫你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...we have not come to rob you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.77,0:47:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我是来解决问题的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but to seek fair settlement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.55,0:47:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,能跟我谈谈吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will you not speak with me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.57,0:47:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我洗耳恭听\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am listening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.00,0:47:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我代表长湖镇的人民\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On behalf of the people of Lake-town...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.00,0:47:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,要求您履行承诺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I ask that you honor your pledge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.81,0:47:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,和他们分享财宝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A share of the treasure...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.87,0:48:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,好让他们能够重建家园\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...so that they might rebuild their lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.23,0:48:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会跟任何...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will not treat with any man...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.05,0:48:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,挟着大军压境的人讨价还价\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...while an armed host lies before my door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.60,0:48:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,要是我们不能达成协议 大军就会攻打孤山\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That armed host will attack this Mountain if we do not come to terms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.75,0:48:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你的威胁并不能使我动摇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And your threats do not sway me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.36,0:48:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你的良心何在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What of your conscience?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.39,0:48:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,难道我们的请求不是理所应当的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does it not tell you our cause is just?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.52,0:48:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我的人民帮助过你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My people offered you help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.62,0:48:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,而你却带给他们的死亡和毁灭作为回报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And in return, you brought upon them only ruin and death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.62,0:48:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,长湖镇的人难道不是为了丰厚的报酬才帮我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When did Lake-town come to our aid but for the promise of rich reward?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.26,0:48:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,那是公平的交易\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A bargain was struck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.66,0:48:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,交易\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A bargain?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.40,0:48:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我们除了拿祖传宝藏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What choice did we have but to barter our birthright...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.84,0:48:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,去交换毛毯和食物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...for blankets and food?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.64,0:48:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,好争取自由换取未来 还能怎么办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To ransom our future in exchange for our freedom?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.61,0:48:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你说那是公平的交易\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You call that a fair trade?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.01,0:48:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.64,0:48:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,屠龙者巴德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...Bard the Dragon-Slayer...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.97,0:48:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我为什么要遵守这样的约定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...why should I honor such terms?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.66,0:49:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你给过我们承诺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because you gave us your word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.00,0:49:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,难道这承诺一文不值\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does that mean nothing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.57,0:49:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,走开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be gone!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.67,0:49:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,不然我就要放箭了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ere our arrows fly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.17,0:49:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你在做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.62,0:49:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能挑起战争\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You cannot go to war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.48,0:49:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这和你没关系 - 不好意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This does not concern you. - Excuse me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.80,0:49:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,防止你没注意到 我得提醒你外面有一支精灵大军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but in case you haven't noticed, there is an army of Elves out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.88,0:50:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,更别说有几百个愤怒的渔民\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not to mention several hundred angry fishermen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.84,0:50:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我们实际上寡不敌众\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are, in fact, outnumbered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.60,0:50:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,不会太久的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not for much longer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.80,0:50:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What does that mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.42,0:50:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,意思是 巴金斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It means, Master Baggins...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.56,0:50:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,永远不要低估矮人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you should never underestimate Dwarves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.57,0:50:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我们能收复埃尔波尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have reclaimed Erebor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.72,0:50:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.27,0:50:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,也能守住它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...we defend it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.57,0:50:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,他一毛不拔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He will give us nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.94,0:50:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,真可惜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Such a pity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.35,0:50:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- 至少你试过了 - 我搞不明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Still you tried. - I do not understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.94,0:50:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.79,0:50:57.27,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么他宁愿挑起战争\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why would he risk war?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.73,0:51:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,和他们讲理是白费力气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is fruitless to reason with them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.31,0:51:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,他们现在只认这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They understand only one thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.90,0:51:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在拂晓发动进攻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We attack at dawn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.24,0:51:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你要和我们一起吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you with us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.41,0:51:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.37,0:52:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,巴金斯先生 过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Master Baggins, come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.04,0:52:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你会用得着这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're going to need this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.24,0:52:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,穿上它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put it on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.50,0:52:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,这件背心由银合金制成\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This vest is made of silver steel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.72,0:52:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,秘银\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mithril...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.40,0:52:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我的祖先这样称呼它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...it was called by my forebears.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.52,0:52:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,穿上它刀剑不入\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No blade can pierce it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.10,0:52:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来很滑稽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I look absurd.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.14,0:52:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是战士 只是个霍比特人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not a warrior, I'm a Hobbit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.51,0:53:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,这是件礼物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is a gift.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.54,0:53:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,作为我们友谊的象征\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A token of our friendship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.55,0:53:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,真朋友千金难求\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}True friends are hard to come by.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.51,0:53:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我以前看走了眼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have been blind...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.51,0:53:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,不过现在看清了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but now I begin to see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.37,0:53:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,有人背叛了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am betrayed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.58,0:53:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,背叛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Betrayed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.40,0:53:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,阿肯宝石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Arkenstone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.27,0:53:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,他们中有人拿去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One of them has taken it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.51,0:53:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,他们中有人撒了谎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One of them is false.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.51,0:53:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,索林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thorin...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.54,0:53:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你的心愿已经实现 你夺回了孤山\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...the Quest is fulfilled, you've won the Mountain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.00,0:53:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,这还不够吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that not enough?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.44,0:53:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 被自己的同胞背叛 - 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Betrayed by my own kin. - Now, uh...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.64,0:54:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你对长湖镇的人们许下承诺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you made a promise to the people of Lake-town.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.37,0:54:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,难道 财宝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, is this treasure...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.84,0:54:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,真比自己的名誉还重要吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...truly worth more than your honor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.48,0:54:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的名誉 索林 我当时也帮你说了话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our honor, Thorin. I was also there. I gave my word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.83,0:54:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,对于此事 我心存感激\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For that, I am grateful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.87,0:54:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,那是高尚的表现 但是孤山的财宝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was nobly done, but the treasure of this mountain...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.37,0:54:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,并不属于长湖镇的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...does not belong to the people...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.70,0:54:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,居民\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...of Lake-town.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.12,0:54:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,这些黄金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This gold...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.32,0:54:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,是我们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...is ours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.56,0:54:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,只能是我们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And ours alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.81,0:54:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我用生命起誓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By my life...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.32,0:54:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我绝不舍弃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I will not part...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.00,0:54:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,任何金币\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...with a single coin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.08,0:54:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,哪怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.70,0:54:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,一小块\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...one..{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.70,0:54:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,也不会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...piece of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.76,0:55:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,冈达巴山\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gundabad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.41,0:55:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,山里面有什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What lies beyond?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.36,0:55:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,一个宿敌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An old enemy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.29,0:55:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,古老的安格玛王国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The ancient kingdom of Angmar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.85,0:55:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,这些堡垒曾经是他们的大本营\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This fortress was once its stronghold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.53,0:55:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,是他们补给装备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is where they kept their great armories.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.22,0:55:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,打造兵器的兵工厂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forged their weapons of war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.92,0:55:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,有光 我看到人影走动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A light. I saw movement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.77,0:55:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我们等天黑了再行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We wait for the cover of night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.57,0:55:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,这个地方很凶险 塔瑞尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is a fell place, Tauriel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.42,0:55:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,上个世纪 我们的族人曾在这里血战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In another age, our people waged war on those lands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.45,0:55:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我的母亲死在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My mother died there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.88,0:56:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,父王从不提起这件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My father does not speak of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.64,0:56:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,没有坟墓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is no grave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.86,0:56:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,没有哀思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No memory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.96,0:56:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,什么都没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.99,0:56:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,让我过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me through!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.72,0:56:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,让开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make Way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.16,0:56:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.56,0:56:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,不 喂 你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! Oi! You!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.78,0:56:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,尖帽子那个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pointy hat!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.86,0:56:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.08,0:56:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,就是你 我们不收流浪汉 乞丐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You. We don't want no tramps, beggars...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.32,0:56:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,别在这里转悠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...nor vagabonds here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.97,0:56:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的麻烦都已经够多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got enough trouble without the likes of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.80,0:56:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,骑上你的马 快滚吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Off you go. On your horse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.16,0:57:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,谁是这里管事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's in charge here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.56,0:57:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,是谁在问\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who is asking?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.99,0:57:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你们和矮人的恩怨必须先放在一边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must set aside your petty grievances with the Dwarves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.22,0:57:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,战争就要来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}War is coming!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.36,0:57:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,多尔戈多的敌军倾巢而出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The cesspits of Dol Guldur have been emptied.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.67,0:57:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你们都处于危险之中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're all in mortal danger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.23,0:57:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你在说些什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.78,0:57:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,看得出你对巫师一无所知\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can see you know nothing of Wizards.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.68,0:57:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,他们就像冬日的响雷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They are like winter thunder on a wild wind...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.59,0:57:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,自远方随狂风而来 轰隆作响让人惊慌不已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...rolling in from a distance, breaking hard in alarm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.60,0:57:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,但往往只是雷声大雨点小\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But sometimes a storm is just a storm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.94,0:57:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,这次不一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not this time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.92,0:57:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,半兽人军队正在路上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Armies of Orcs are on the move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.31,0:57:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,它们都是杀手 为战争而生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These are fighters. They have been bred for war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.05,0:57:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的敌人动用了全部力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our enemy has summoned his full strength.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.56,0:57:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么它们现在才行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why show his hand now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.16,0:57:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,是我们逼的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because we forced him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.16,0:57:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,自从索林·橡木盾一行人动身去收复孤山起开始的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We forced him when the Company of Thorin set out to reclaim their homeland.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.00,0:57:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,它们绝不愿意看到矮人回到埃尔波尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Dwarves were never meant to reach Erebor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.72,0:57:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,毁灭者阿佐格奉命去追杀他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Azog the Defiler was sent to kill them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.81,0:58:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,他的主人 想要掌控孤山\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His master seeks control of the Mountain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.03,0:58:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,不仅是因为那里面的财宝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not just for the treasure within...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.78,0:58:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,还有孤山的战略位置 有利的地形\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but for where it lies, its strategic position.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.16,0:58:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,这里是夺回北方古国安格玛的要塞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the gateway to reclaiming the lands of Angmar in the North.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.75,0:58:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,如果那个失落的王国再度崛起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If that fell kingdom should rise again...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.68,0:58:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,瑞文戴尔 罗瑞安 夏尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...Rivendell, Lórien, the Shire...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.52,0:58:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,甚至刚铎王国 也会陷落\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...even Gondor itself, will fall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.08,0:58:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你说的这些半兽人军队 米斯兰达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These Orc armies you speak of, Mithrandir...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.12,0:58:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,现在在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...where are they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.07,0:59:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,这些蝙蝠的存在只为一个目的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These bats are bred for one purpose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.51,0:59:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,什么目的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.15,0:59:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,战争\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.28,1:00:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧 我们把那些刀磨得锋利些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, let's get those blades sharpened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.22,1:00:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 该死的精灵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye. Blasted Elves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.69,1:00:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你用斧头砍了？- 没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You swing an ax at it? - No, brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.97,1:00:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你该待在屋里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should be inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.86,1:00:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,出来放风\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Out of the wind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.84,1:00:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.16,1:01:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,出来透透气 这地儿龙的臭味太重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...needed some air. Place still stinks of dragon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.84,1:01:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,精灵大军的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Elves have been moving...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.93,1:01:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- 弓箭手已经就位了 - 是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...their archers into position. - Ah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.60,1:01:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,明天战斗将见个分晓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The battle will be over by tomorrow's eve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.96,1:01:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然我怀疑 我们会活到最后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Though I doubt we will live to see it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.29,1:01:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,这真是暗无天日啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, these are dark days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.58,1:01:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,确实是暗无天日\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dark days indeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.70,1:01:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hmm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.20,1:01:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,即使你不想被困在这里 也没有人会责备你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one could blame a soul for wishing themselves elsewhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.58,1:01:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,已经快到午夜了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Must be nearing midnight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.57,1:01:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,邦博会接替巡查\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bombur's got the next watch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.12,1:01:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我去叫醒他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It'll take a bit to wake him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.46,1:01:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,波佛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bofur?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.63,1:01:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我们明天早上见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will see you in the morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.68,1:02:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,再见 比尔博\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goodbye, Bilbo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.40,1:02:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,什么时候起我的忠告变得一文不值\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Since when has my counsel counted for so little?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.18,1:02:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你以为我想干嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you think I'm trying to do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.42,1:02:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我想你只是在试图拯救你的矮人朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you try to save your Dwarvish friends,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.12,1:02:57.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我钦佩你对他们的忠诚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I admire your loyalty to them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.68,1:03:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,但这不足以构成我停兵的理由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it does not dissuade me from my course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.51,1:03:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,这一切由你而起 米斯兰达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You started this, Mithrandir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.77,1:03:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你不介意由我来收尾吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will forgive me if I finish it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.94,1:03:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,弓箭手就位了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are the archers in position?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.18,1:03:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是的 陛下 - 传我命令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes, my lord. - Give the order.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.24,1:03:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,若山上有任何风吹草动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If anything moves on that Mountain...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.89,1:03:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,格杀勿论\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...kill it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.95,1:03:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,矮人的大限已到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Dwarves are out of time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.74,1:03:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,神箭手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bowman!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.39,1:03:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你同意他说的话吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you agree with this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.21,1:03:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,金子对你来说有那么重要吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is gold so important to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.11,1:03:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,难道为了得到财宝不惜让矮人流血吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you buy it with the blood of Dwarves?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.86,1:03:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,不会发展到那一步的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It won't come to that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.45,1:03:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这场仗他们赢不了 - 他们不会认输的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This is a fight they cannot win. - That won't stop them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.77,1:03:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你认为矮人会投降 不会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think the Dwarves will surrender? They won't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.57,1:03:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,他们会为了家园战斗至死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They will fight to the death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.92,1:03:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,比尔博·巴金斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bilbo Baggins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.40,1:03:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我没搞错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I'm not mistaken...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.80,1:03:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是在我守卫的眼皮底下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...this is the Halfling who stole the keys...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.12,1:03:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,偷走地牢钥匙的半身人吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...to my dungeons from under the nose of my guards.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.22,1:03:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.64,1:03:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,那件事很抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry about that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.62,1:04:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I came...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.20,1:04:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,是给你们这个的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...to give you this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.77,1:04:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,孤山之心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Heart of the Mountain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.92,1:04:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,王之珍宝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The King's Jewel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.29,1:04:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,足以让国王将其赎回\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And worth a king's ransom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.67,1:04:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么能把它给我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How is this yours to give?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.58,1:04:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我把它当作我十四分之一份额的报酬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I took it as my 14th share of the treasure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.34,1:04:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么这么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why would you do this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.89,1:04:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你不欠我们什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You owe us no loyalty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.20,1:04:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是为了你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not doing it for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.36,1:04:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道矮人们非常顽固\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know that Dwarves can be obstinate...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.41,1:04:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,执着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and pigheaded...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.48,1:04:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,难缠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and difficult.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.81,1:04:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,多疑 神神秘秘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're suspicious and secretive...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.82,1:04:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你想象不到他们举止有多没礼貌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...with the worst manners you can possibly imagine,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.01,1:04:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,但他们也不失勇敢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but they are also brave...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.87,1:04:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,善良\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and kind...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.82,1:04:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,而且非常忠诚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and loyal to a fault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.73,1:04:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我很喜欢他们 我想尽可能的去救他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've grown very fond of them, and I would save them if I can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.98,1:04:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,对索林来说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, Thorin...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.04,1:04:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,他珍视这宝石胜过一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...values this stone above all else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.82,1:05:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,为了宝石 我想他会归还属于你们的财宝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In exchange for its return, I believe he will give you what you are owed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.68,1:05:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,没有必要再去发动战争\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There will be no need for war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.90,1:05:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,今晚好好休息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rest up tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.32,1:05:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- 明天一早就得离开 - 什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You must leave on the morrow. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.16,1:05:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- 走得越远越好 - 我是不会离开的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get as far away from here as possible. - I'm not leaving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.72,1:05:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你选我为这个集体的十四分之一 我现在还不想离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You picked me as the 14th man. I'm not leaving the Company, now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.72,1:05:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,不再有什么集体了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is no Company. Not anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.02,1:05:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,天知道索林发现你的行为后会做出什么事来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Imagine what Thorin will do when he finds out what you've done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.56,1:05:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我不害怕索林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not afraid of Thorin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.59,1:05:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该害怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you should be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.70,1:05:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,不要低估了那些金子的邪恶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't underestimate the evil of gold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.99,1:05:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,尤其是恶龙长期盘踞过的金子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gold over which a serpent has long brooded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.22,1:05:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,龙症会侵蚀每个靠近孤山的人的心灵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dragon-sickness seeps into the hearts of all who come near this Mountain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.54,1:05:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,几乎无人幸免\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Almost all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.26,1:05:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你 过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.55,1:05:48.03,Default,,0,0,0,,给这霍比特人找张床\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find this Hobbit a bed...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.93,1:05:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,备好热饭让他饱餐一顿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and fill his belly with hot food.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.90,1:05:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,他应得的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's earned it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.37,1:05:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.68,1:05:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,暗中留意他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep an eye on him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.22,1:06:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,只要他试图离开 你立刻向我报告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If he should try to leave, you tell me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.87,1:06:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.77,1:06:08.39,Default,,0,0,0,,愚蠢的霍比特人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stupid Hobbit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.36,1:06:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,醒醒 醒醒 霍比特人 该起床了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wakey-wakey, Hobbit. Up you...get.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.20,1:07:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,下一箭会射中你的眉心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will put the next one between your eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.84,1:07:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我们前来告诉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have come to tell you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.92,1:07:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你们偿还的欠款已经收到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...payment of your debt has been offered...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.48,1:07:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我们笑纳了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and accepted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.44,1:07:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,什么欠款\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What payment?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.53,1:07:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我什么都没给你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gave you nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.60,1:07:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你们什么都没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.26,1:07:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我们有这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.66,1:08:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,他们拿着阿肯宝石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They have the Arkenstone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.69,1:08:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,盗贼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thieves!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.43,1:08:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么会有我们祖传宝物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How came you by the heirloom of our house?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.76,1:08:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,这宝石属于国王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That stone belongs to the king!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.05,1:08:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,国王可以拿到它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the king may have it...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.96,1:08:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我们也很乐意归还\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...with our goodwill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.38,1:08:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,但首先他得兑现他的诺言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But first he must honor his word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.82,1:08:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,他们把我们当傻子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They are taking us for fools.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.40,1:08:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,这是个骗局\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a ruse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.21,1:08:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,肮脏的谎言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A filthy lie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.34,1:08:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,阿肯宝石还在山里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Arkenstone is in this Mountain!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.48,1:08:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,这是个诡计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is a trick!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.57,1:08:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是诡计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's no trick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.31,1:08:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,宝石是真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The stone is real.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.51,1:08:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我给他们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gave it to them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.50,1:08:57.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.63,1:09:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我把它当作我应得的那份报酬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I took it as my 14th share.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.66,1:09:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,是你从我这里偷走的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You would steal from me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.65,1:09:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,从你那偷走 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Steal from you? No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.24,1:09:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我也许是个飞贼 但我自认为是诚实的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I may be a burglar, but I like to think I'm an honest one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.39,1:09:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我应得的部分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll let it stand against my claim.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.12,1:09:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,应得的部分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Against your claim?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.64,1:09:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你的权利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your claim.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.18,1:09:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你无权凌驾于我之上 你这个卑鄙的鼠辈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have no claim over me, you miserable rat!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.74,1:09:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我本来是准备交给你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was going to give it to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.50,1:09:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- 很多次都想 但是 - 但是 什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Many times I wanted to, but... - But what...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.79,1:09:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,窃贼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...thief?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.03,1:09:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你变了 索林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are changed, Thorin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.92,1:09:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我在袋底洞认识的那个矮人 从不食言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Dwarf I met in Bag End would never have gone back on his word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.89,1:09:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,也绝不会质疑族人对他的忠诚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would never have doubted the loyalty of his kin!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.00,1:09:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你还跟我谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do not speak to me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.86,1:09:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,忠诚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...of loyalty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.05,1:09:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,把他从城墙上扔下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Throw him from the rampart!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.80,1:10:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你们没有听到吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you not hear me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.58,1:10:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我亲自动手 我诅咒你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will do it myself. Curse you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.85,1:10:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.42,1:10:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,诅咒把你强加于\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cursed be the Wizard...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.56,1:10:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们的巫师 - 如果你对我的飞贼不满意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...that forced you on us! - If you don't like my burglar...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.52,1:10:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,请你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...then please...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.56,1:10:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,不要伤害他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...don't damage him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.68,1:10:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,把他还给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Return him to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.77,1:10:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你没给自己树立好山下国王正面的形象\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not making a very splendid figure as King under the Mountain...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.70,1:10:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你说呢 索林 索恩之子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...are you, Thorin...son of Thrain?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.65,1:10:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我永远不会再与巫师做交易\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never again will I have dealings with Wizards!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.91,1:10:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快走 - 还有夏尔的鼠辈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Go. - Or Shire rats!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.48,1:10:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,可以谈判了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are we resolved?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.10,1:10:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,用阿肯宝石换取你的承诺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The return of the Arkenstone for what was promised?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.17,1:11:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么我要花钱买回 本来就属于我的东西？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why should I buy back that which is rightfully mine?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.18,1:11:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,留着宝石 卖掉算了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep the stone, sell it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.17,1:11:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,刚铎的执政宰相会给你开个好价的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ecthelion of Gondor will give you a good price for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.54,1:11:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我要杀了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will kill you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.93,1:11:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我发誓 我要干掉你们所有人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By my oath, I will kill you all!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.20,1:11:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你的誓言一毛不值\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your oath means nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.59,1:11:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我听够了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've heard enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.80,1:11:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,索林 撤掉你的军队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thorin, lay down your arms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.38,1:11:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,打开大门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open these doors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.62,1:11:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,宝藏会害死你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This treasure will be your death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.35,1:11:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,索林 我们赢不了这场战斗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thorin, we cannot win this fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.96,1:12:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,快给我们答案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give us your answer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.93,1:12:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你是选择和平\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will you have peace...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.22,1:12:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,还是战争\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...or war?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.10,1:12:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我选择战争\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will have war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.10,1:12:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,铁足丹恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ironfoot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.69,1:12:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 索林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Thorin!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.45,1:13:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,铁足军团赶到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ironfoot has come!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.93,1:13:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,那是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.77,1:13:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来可不友善\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He doesn't look very happy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.01,1:13:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,他叫丹恩 是铁丘陵国王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is Dain, Lord of the Iron Hills.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.55,1:13:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,索林的堂兄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thorin's cousin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.02,1:13:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,他俩相像吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are they alike?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.04,1:13:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得他比索林更不理智\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've always found Thorin the more reasonable of the two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.89,1:13:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,早上好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.24,1:13:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,大家还好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How are we all?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.49,1:13:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我有个小小的提议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have a wee proposition...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.15,1:13:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,如果不介意我花费一点你们宝贵的时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...if you wouldn't mind giving me a few moments of your time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.18,1:13:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,可否考虑一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you consider...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.47,1:13:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,自己滚开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...just sodding off?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.80,1:13:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,所有人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All of you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.95,1:13:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,马上滚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.09,1:13:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,不许后退\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stand fast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.98,1:13:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,冷静一下 丹恩大王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come now, Lord Dain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.72,1:14:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,灰袍甘道夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gandalf the Grey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.27,1:14:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,叫这群乌合之众散了 不然我会让他们血流成河\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell this rabble to leave, or I'll water the ground with their blood!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.36,1:14:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,矮人 人类和精灵没有必要挑起战争\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is no need for war between Dwarves, Men and Elves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.98,1:14:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,一大批半兽人正在朝孤山涌来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A legion of Orcs march on the Mountain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.13,1:14:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,叫你的人冷静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stand down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.22,1:14:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会在任何精灵面前冷静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will not stand down before any Elf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.90,1:14:27.35,Default,,0,0,0,,尤其是这背信弃义的林地精灵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not least this faithless Woodland sprite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.90,1:14:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,他一心只想让我的人民遭殃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wishes nothing but ill upon my people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.21,1:14:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,如果他选择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If he chooses...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.26,1:14:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,依然和我们作对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...to stand between me and my kin...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.56,1:14:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我就让他的脑袋开花\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I'll split his pretty head open!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.92,1:14:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,看他是不是还会那样傻笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See if he's still smirking then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.68,1:14:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,丹恩 等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dain, wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.30,1:14:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,让他们推进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let them advance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.94,1:14:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,看他们能走多远\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See how far they get.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.03,1:14:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你以为我的威胁是放屁吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think I give a dead dog for your threats,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.79,1:15:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你个尖耳朵小公主\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you pointy-eared princess?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.50,1:15:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你们也听到了 我们上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You hear that, lads? We're on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.51,1:15:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,好好赏给这些杂种们几锤子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's give these bastards a good hammering!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.08,1:15:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,让你的人别动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stand your men down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.34,1:15:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我来对付铁足军团这群乌合之众\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll deal with Ironfoot and his rabble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.08,1:15:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,准备好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.18,1:15:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,等下再发射\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get this done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.67,1:15:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,派出羊骑兵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Send in the goats.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.62,1:15:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,瑟兰迪尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thranduil!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.60,1:15:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,这太疯狂了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is madness!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.81,1:16:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 你喜欢这个么 你个老绣花枕头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you like that, the old twirley-whirlies?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.52,1:16:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,哈哈 死变态\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ha, ha, you buggers!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.72,1:17:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,地蛇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Were-Worms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.24,1:17:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托 不要吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.17,1:18:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,地狱大军已来袭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The hordes of hell are upon us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.40,1:18:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,至死方休\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fight to the death!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.49,1:18:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我要出去打仗 谁和我一起去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going over the wall. Who's coming with me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.58,1:18:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好 - 快点 我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Aye! - Come on, let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.54,1:18:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- 站住 - 什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Stand down. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.76,1:18:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要袖手旁观吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are we to do nothing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.07,1:18:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我说了 站住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said, stand down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.18,1:18:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,精灵们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Elves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.77,1:18:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,他们不去战斗吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will they not fight?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.28,1:19:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,冲啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Charge!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.50,1:19:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.50,1:19:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,甘道夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, Gandalf?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.66,1:19:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我们站在这合适吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this a good place to stand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.12,1:21:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,阿索格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Azog.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.02,1:21:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,他想断我们的后路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's trying to cut us off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.53,1:21:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,所有的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All of you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.23,1:21:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,立刻退回河谷镇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fall back to Dale!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.46,1:21:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.74,1:21:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,到镇里去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To the city!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.00,1:21:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,比尔博 这边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bilbo! This Way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.68,1:22:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,西格丽特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sigrid!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.90,1:22:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,蒂尔达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tilda!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.89,1:22:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我的孩子 他们在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My children! Where are my children?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.36,1:22:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我看见了 他们之前在老集市\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw them! They were down in the old market!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.56,1:22:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,老集市\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The market?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.38,1:22:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,那现在又在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are they now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.89,1:22:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,蒂尔达 西格丽特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tilda! Sigrid!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.76,1:22:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,巴德 半兽人涌进了堤道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bard! Orcs are storming over the causeway!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.77,1:23:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,带弓箭手去东面的城墙 抵挡得越久越好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get the bowmen to the eastern parapet. Hold them off as long as you can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.89,1:23:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,弓箭手 跟我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Archers! This way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.30,1:23:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,半兽人攻占了石街\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Orcs have taken Stone Street!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.63,1:23:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,集市已失手了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The market's overrun!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.68,1:23:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,剩下的人 跟我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The rest of you follow me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.80,1:23:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- 战斗 - 前进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Charge! - Onward!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.25,1:23:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,决一死战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To the death!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.30,1:24:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Da!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.47,1:24:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Da!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.35,1:24:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这边 - 我们在这边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Here! - We're down here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.23,1:24:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,贝恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bain!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.43,1:24:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,西格丽特 快趴下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sigrid! Get down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.16,1:25:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,听好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.56,1:25:42.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我要你们把孩子和女人聚集起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need you to gather the women and children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.60,1:25:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,带他们到大殿去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take them to the Great Hall...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.99,1:25:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,把门封住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and barricade the door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.05,1:25:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,明白吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You understand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.37,1:25:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,不管什么原因都别出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must not come out for any reason.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.19,1:25:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要和你在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We want to stay with you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.45,1:25:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,听你父亲的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Show your father some respect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.02,1:25:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,把他们交给我 大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You leave it to me, sire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.35,1:25:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你听到他说的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You heard him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.37,1:25:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们去大殿 - 阿尔弗雷德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We make for the Great Hall. - Alfrid!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.31,1:26:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,只有妇孺可以避难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Women and children only.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.95,1:26:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我要所有男人参战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need every man fighting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.74,1:26:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你务必回来战斗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See that you return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.52,1:26:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我保证把他们安全送达 大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll get them to safety, sire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.97,1:26:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,然后我就马上回来 快起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then my sword is yours to command. Get up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.24,1:26:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,照顾好她们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look after them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.88,1:26:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 老太婆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shift it, granny!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.50,1:26:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,快去大殿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make for the Great Hall!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.44,1:26:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,都给我让开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Out of my way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.73,1:26:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,跑不动的就别管了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Abandon the cripples!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.74,1:27:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你个杂种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You buggers!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:53.68,1:27:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,索林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thorin{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.37,1:27:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,索林在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's Thorin?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.80,1:28:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要他 他在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need him! Where is he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.32,1:28:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,撤退\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fall back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.86,1:28:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,从什么时候开始我们不管自己人的死活了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Since when do we forsake our own people?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.61,1:28:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,索林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thorin...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.15,1:28:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在外面流血牺牲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...they are dying out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.77,1:29:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,这山里地洞连着地洞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are halls beneath halls within this Mountain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.19,1:29:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可以用来防御\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Places we can fortify...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.57,1:29:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,稳固地势 确保安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...shore up, make safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:09.40,1:29:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.69,1:29:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.71,1:29:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...that is it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.64,1:29:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得把金子移到更深的地下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must move the gold further underground...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.68,1:29:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- 保证它们安全 - 你到底有没有听我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...to safety. - Did you hear me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.69,1:29:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,丹恩正被敌军包围\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dain is surrounded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.61,1:29:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,他们快被杀光了 索林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're being slaughtered, Thorin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.05,1:29:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,战争总会死人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Many die in war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.77,1:29:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,人命如草芥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Life is cheap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.64,1:29:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,失去的那些人远没有宝藏重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But a treasure such as this cannot be counted in lives lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.69,1:29:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,为了金子死多少人都值得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is worth all the blood we can spend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.53,1:29:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你坐在这宏伟的大厅里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You sit here in these vast halls...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.25,1:29:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,头上戴着王冠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...with a crown upon your head...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.52,1:29:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,实际上却比以往任何时候都渺小\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and yet you are lesser now than you have ever been.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.36,1:29:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,不许这样说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do not speak to me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.02,1:30:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,好像我还是那个卑微的矮人王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...as if I were some lowly Dwarf Lord...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.95,1:30:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,就像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...as if...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.30,1:30:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我仍然是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I were still...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.64,1:30:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,索林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...Thorin...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:14.80,1:30:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,橡木盾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...Oakenshield.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:17.99,1:30:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我是你们的国王 - 你一直是我的国王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I am your king! - You were always my king.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.65,1:30:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,一直以来都是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You used to know that once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.87,1:30:27.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你看不见自己如今变成了什么样子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You cannot see what you have become.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.92,1:30:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,滚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:34.85,1:30:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.68,1:30:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,趁我还没杀死你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Before I kill you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.05,1:30:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你坐在这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You sit here...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:56.56,1:30:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,头上戴着王冠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...with a crown upon your head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:59.60,1:31:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,比以往任何时候都渺小\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are lesser now than you have ever been.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:01.78,1:31:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,失去的那些人远没有宝藏重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But a treasure such as this cannot be counted in lives lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.08,1:31:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,那些宝藏带有邪气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A sickness lies upon that treasure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:08.44,1:31:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,孤山国王 贪得无厌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The blind ambition of a Mountain King.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.58,1:31:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,难道我不是国王吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Am I not the king?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.49,1:31:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,这些黄金是我们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This gold is ours...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.65,1:31:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,也只能属于我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And ours alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.68,1:31:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,储存的财宝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Treasure hoard...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.19,1:31:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会把\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will not part...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:21.80,1:31:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,任何一个金币分出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...with a single coin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.32,1:31:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,他鼠目寸光 只看得到自己的欲望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He could not see beyond his own desire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:25.84,1:31:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,好像我还是那个卑微的矮人王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As if I were some lowly Dwarf Lord...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:28.39,1:31:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,索林·橡木盾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...Thorin Oakenshield.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.16,1:31:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,宝藏的邪气曾让你祖父疯狂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A sickness which drove your grandfather mad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.97,1:31:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,橡木盾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thorin Oakenshield.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.34,1:31:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这是索林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Thorin...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.95,1:31:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,索恩之子 索尔之孙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...son of Thrain, son of Thror!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.12,1:31:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是我的祖父\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am not my grandfather.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.49,1:31:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你是都灵王位的继承人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are the heir to the Throne of Durin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:44.38,1:31:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在外面流血牺牲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They are dying out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.44,1:31:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,夺回埃尔波尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take back Erebor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.06,1:31:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,丹恩正被敌军包围\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dain is surrounded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.99,1:31:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,垂死挣扎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.86,1:31:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,被敌军包围\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is surrounded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.47,1:31:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,垂死挣扎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:53.30,1:31:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,收复你的家园\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take back your homeland.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:56.97,1:31:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你变了 索林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are changed, Thorin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:59.18,1:32:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是我的祖父\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am not my grandfather.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:01.27,1:32:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,财宝真的比自己的名誉还重要吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this treasure truly worth more than your honor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:04.50,1:32:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是我的祖父\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am not my grandfather.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:19.48,1:32:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,这些宝藏会害死你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This treasure will be your death!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:05.16,1:33:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,撤退\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fall back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:06.98,1:33:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,向孤山撤退\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fall back to the Mountain!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.51,1:33:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,后退\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fall back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:56.53,1:33:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会再躲在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will not hide...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.44,1:33:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,石墙后面了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...behind a wall of stone...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:59.80,1:34:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,让别人还在外面为我们拼命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...while others fight our battles for us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:06.74,1:34:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是我们家族的传统 索林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is not in my blood, Thorin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:13.84,1:34:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:15.51,1:34:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,绝不是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:18.97,1:34:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是都灵的子孙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are sons of Durin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:24.13,1:34:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,身为都灵的后人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And Durin's Folk...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:26.97,1:34:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不能在战斗中退缩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...do not flee from a fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:52.33,1:34:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有权力再要求你们所有人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have no right to ask this of any of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:01.17,1:35:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,但你们愿意跟随我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But will you follow me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:04.52,1:35:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,最后一次吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...one last time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:51.81,1:35:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,索林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thorin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:18.59,1:36:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,为了国王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To the king!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:21.06,1:36:23.81,Default,,0,0,0,,为了国王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To the king!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:47.88,1:36:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,那些矮人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Dwarves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:49.50,1:36:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在反击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're rallying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:53.85,1:36:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,他们为了国王战斗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're rallying to their king.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:10.92,1:37:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,所有愿意抗争到底的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any man who wants to give their last...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:14.27,1:37:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...follow me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:23.43,1:37:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 邦博 快起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Bombur. Get up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:02.97,1:38:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- 诺力 - 葛罗音\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Nori. - Gloin!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:04.68,1:38:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,在你身后 兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right behind you, brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:49.30,1:38:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我说咱们应该和男人们同生共死 并肩作战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I say we stand with our men in life and in death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:53.01,1:38:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我也去 - 拿起武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm with you. - Arm yourselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:56.05,1:38:57.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- 和我们一起吧 - 不 不 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come with us. - No, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:57.93,1:39:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- 放过我这个老太婆吧 - 别害怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You leave an old woman be. - Don't be afraid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:00.34,1:39:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫你滚开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said, get off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:03.64,1:39:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,是马屁精阿尔弗雷德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alfrid Lickspittle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:05.45,1:39:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你就是一个懦夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are a coward.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:06.88,1:39:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,"懦夫"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Coward"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.15,1:39:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,不是每个男人都有胆子穿女人的束胸衣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not every man's brave enough to wear a corset.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:10.57,1:39:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你不配当男人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not a man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:11.80,1:39:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你是个鼠辈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a weasel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:45.04,1:39:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,丹恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dain!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:46.99,1:39:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,索林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thorin!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:49.06,1:39:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,撑住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:50.27,1:39:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm coming!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:59.10,1:40:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 我说堂弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, cousin!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:02.04,1:40:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么这么久才来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What took you so long?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:07.74,1:40:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,这里的丑八怪太多了 索林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's too many of these buggers, Thorin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:11.12,1:40:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,希望你已经有计划了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope you've got a plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:13.86,1:40:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:15.24,1:40:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我们去干掉他们的头领\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're going to take out their leader.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:18.20,1:40:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,阿索格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Azog?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:23.07,1:40:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我要杀了那头肮脏的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna kill that piece of filth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:25.40,1:40:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,索林 你不能这么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thorin, you cannot do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:27.60,1:40:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你是我们的国王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're our king.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:29.37,1:40:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我才要亲自去做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is why I must do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:31.99,1:40:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,那你计划怎么单枪匹马杀开一条路去渡鸦岭？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And how do you plan to fight your way single-handed to Ravenhill?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:36.88,1:40:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,停下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Halt!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:44.23,1:40:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我有段时间没开过这玩意儿了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's been a while since I've done this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:47.64,1:40:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,去渡鸦岭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To Ravenhill!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:49.36,1:40:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,抓紧了 伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold tight, lads.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:51.12,1:40:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你们这群疯狂的家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're all mad bastards.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:54.52,1:40:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:57.80,1:40:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,希望都灵保佑你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May Durin save you all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:41.87,1:41:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:50.99,1:41:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,眼睛看前面 伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eyes front lads!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:01.77,1:42:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,坚持住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:09.81,1:42:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,换弹夹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:20.49,1:42:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,放倒那家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring it down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:22.44,1:42:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- 射死他 - 射哪里？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Shoot it! - Where?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:24.18,1:42:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,瞄准他的咽喉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In his jambags!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:26.32,1:42:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,这货没有喉咙啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It doesn't have any jambags!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:28.45,1:42:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- 低头 - 奇力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Duck! - Kili!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:32.08,1:42:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:34.85,1:42:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,坚持住 伙计 我来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hang on, lads! I'm coming!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:48.74,1:42:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,波佛 你太帅了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bofur, you beauty!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:57.76,1:42:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- 德瓦林 - 前进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Dwalin! - Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:04.44,1:43:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧 你这没毛的豪猪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, you hairy hedgepig!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:07.31,1:43:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,来啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:12.76,1:43:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,耶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:13.64,1:43:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- 耶 - 耶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah! - Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:16.82,1:43:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,座狼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wargs!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:33.41,1:43:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,抓紧了 伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold tight, lads.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:50.63,1:43:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,更多的来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's more coming!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:56.27,1:43:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我们载重太多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're pulling too much weight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:57.97,1:43:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我们办不到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We won't make it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:59.63,1:44:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,切断缰绳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cut the tracers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:02.48,1:44:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,骑着他们去渡鸦岭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ride them to Ravenhill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:05.02,1:44:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,不 巴林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Balin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:07.67,1:44:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我骑不动山羊了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My goat-riding days are over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:12.08,1:44:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,都灵保佑你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Durin be with you, brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:42.36,1:44:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我可会玩这个了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am too old for this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:46.85,1:44:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,驾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hyah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:48.31,1:44:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,冲啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Onwards!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:49.46,1:44:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,向前冲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lead on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:22.67,1:45:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,站起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:23.95,1:45:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,离我远点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get away from me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:25.92,1:45:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我不听你的命令了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't take orders from you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:27.68,1:45:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,人民相信你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People trusted you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:28.66,1:45:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,他们听你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They listened to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:30.21,1:45:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,城主的家里有那么多财宝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The master's mantle was there for the taking，
Dialogue: 0,1:45:34.13,1:45:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你却都扔光了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you threw it all away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:36.77,1:45:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,为了什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:46.87,1:45:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,阿尔弗雷德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alfrid...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:48.30,1:45:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你的衬裙露出来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...your slip is showing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:19.08,1:47:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我们没准儿真能赢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We may yet survive this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:22.93,1:47:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,甘道夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gandalf!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:31.76,1:47:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,那是索林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Thorin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:33.50,1:47:34.77,Default,,0,0,0,,跟着菲力和奇力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And Fili, Kili...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:35.08,1:47:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,还有德瓦林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and Dwalin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:36.99,1:47:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,他带了最勇猛的手下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's taking his best warriors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:39.83,1:47:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,去干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To do what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:41.88,1:47:44.03,Default,,0,0,0,,去取那魔头的脑袋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To cut the head off the snake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:17.85,1:48:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,去死吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Die!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:26.03,1:48:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,甘道夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gandalf!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:28.07,1:48:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,莱戈拉斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Legolas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:30.25,1:48:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,莱戈拉斯·绿叶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Legolas Greenleaf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:32.28,1:48:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- 还有一队敌军 - 什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There is a second army. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:33.84,1:48:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,博尔格带领着冈达巴山的半兽人 就快赶到这里了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bolg leads a force of Gundabad Orcs. They are almost upon us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:36.94,1:48:38.11,Default,,0,0,0,,冈达巴山\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gundabad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:39.69,1:48:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是他们的全部计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This was their plan all along.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:43.27,1:48:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,阿索格牵制我们的主力 博尔格趁机从北边进攻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Azog engages our forces, then Bolg sweeps in from the North.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:47.96,1:48:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,什么 从北方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What...The North?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:49.26,1:48:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,哪边是北\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is the North...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:50.84,1:48:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- 到底在哪里 - 在渡鸦岭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- exactly? - Ravenhill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:54.28,1:48:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,渡鸦岭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ravenhill?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:55.24,1:48:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,索林还在那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thorin is up there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:56.88,1:48:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,菲力和奇力 他们都在上面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And Fili and Kili. They're all up there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:15.76,1:49:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,他在哪儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:22.28,1:49:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来空无一人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It looks empty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:25.15,1:49:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我认为阿索格逃了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think Azog has fled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:28.12,1:49:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我看未必\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:32.59,1:49:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,菲力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fili...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:34.72,1:49:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,带上你弟弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...take your brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:36.05,1:49:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,搜寻整座塔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scout out the towers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:38.50,1:49:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,保持低调 隐匿行踪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep low and out of sight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:40.46,1:49:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你发现了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you see something...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:41.46,1:49:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,立即回来报告 不要逗留\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...report back. Do not engage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:43.08,1:49:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- 明白吗 - 我们有伴了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Do you understand? - We have company.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:45.79,1:49:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,哥布林佣兵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goblin mercenaries.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:48.24,1:49:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,不到一百来个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No more than a hundred.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:49.77,1:49:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我们来搞定 你们快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll take care of them. Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:52.07,1:49:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:54.33,1:49:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,来啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:24.12,1:50:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,召回部队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Recall your company.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:31.88,1:50:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,陛下 把军队派遣到渡鸦岭吧 矮人要被突袭了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My lord, dispatch this force to Ravenhill. The Dwarves are about to be overrun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:36.73,1:50:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,得有人警告索林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thorin must be warned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:38.33,1:50:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,那去警告他啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By all means, warn him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:40.10,1:50:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我们精灵在这片被诅咒的地方流了太多血 到此为止\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have spent enough Elvish blood in defense of this accursed land. No more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:45.27,1:50:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,瑟兰迪尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thranduil?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:47.43,1:50:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:49.18,1:50:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,别傻了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't be ridiculous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:50.57,1:50:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你不会成功的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll never make it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:52.05,1:50:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:53.69,1:50:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,因为他们会看见你过来 并杀了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because they will see you coming and kill you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:57.02,1:50:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,不 他们不会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, they won't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:00.02,1:51:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,他们不会看见我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They won't see me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:02.40,1:51:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,绝对不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's out of the question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:05.03,1:51:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我不准许\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I won't allow it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:07.00,1:51:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是在请求你准许 甘道夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not asking you to allow it, Gandalf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:48.30,1:51:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你们不能见死不救\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will not turn away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:50.95,1:51:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,这次不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not this time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:52.73,1:51:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,别挡我的路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out of my way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:54.59,1:51:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,矮人会被屠杀殆尽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Dwarves will be slaughtered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:56.66,1:51:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,是 他们会死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, they will die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:59.84,1:52:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,今天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Today...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:01.95,1:52:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,或明天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...tomorrow...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:03.16,1:52:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,一年之后或百年之后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...one year hence, a hundred years from now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:06.41,1:52:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,那又有什么关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What does it matter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:08.70,1:52:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,他们只是凡人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They are mortal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:12.29,1:52:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你以为你的生命比他们更高贵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think your life is worth more than theirs...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:15.33,1:52:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,可是你心中根本没有爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...when there is no love in it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:17.76,1:52:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你心里根本没有爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is no love in you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:27.48,1:52:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你又懂什么爱了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you know of love?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:29.44,1:52:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,什么也不懂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:31.24,1:52:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你对那个矮人的感情不是真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What you feel for that Dwarf is not real.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:36.38,1:52:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你以为那是爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think it is love?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:39.00,1:52:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,那你准备好为爱而死了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you ready to die for it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:54.65,1:52:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我和你一起去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will go with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:18.84,1:53:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,推\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Push!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:34.99,1:53:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你的斧子掉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By Durin, you've lost your ax.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:39.25,1:53:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,不 他没掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, he's not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:41.72,1:53:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,还给你 堂兄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There you go, cousin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:44.61,1:53:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道你该插在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know where you can stick that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:57.50,1:53:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,别过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey. Stay here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:59.49,1:54:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,继续往下搜查\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Search the lower levels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:02.22,1:54:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,这个我来对付\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:12.82,1:54:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,那个肮脏的半兽人在哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is that Orc filth?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:16.93,1:54:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,索林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thorin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:18.67,1:54:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,比尔博\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bilbo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:20.16,1:54:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你们必须离开这里 赶快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to leave here. Now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:22.06,1:54:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,阿索格还有一支军队 将从北面进攻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Azog has an army attacking from the North.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:24.19,1:54:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,瞭望塔将会完全被包围\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This watchtower will be surrounded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:25.97,1:54:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那时就没有退路了 - 要得手了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- With no way out. - We are so close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:28.04,1:54:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,那个半兽人杂碎就在里面 要我说直接冲进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That Orc scum is in there. I say we push on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:30.39,1:54:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,不 那正是他的目的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. That's what he wants.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:33.26,1:54:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,引诱我们进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wants to draw us in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:37.18,1:54:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,这是个圈套\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a trap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:54.13,1:54:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,找到菲力和奇力 叫他们回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find Fili and Kili. Call them back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:55.97,1:54:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,索林 真要这么做吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thorin, are you sure about this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:57.80,1:54:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,快去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:00.90,1:55:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我们择日再战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll live to fight another day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:38.36,1:55:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:43.26,1:55:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,快跑啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:14.81,1:56:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,奇力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kili!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:16.84,1:56:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,索林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thorin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:20.68,1:56:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,索林 不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thorin. No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:45.47,1:57:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:03.48,1:58:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,奇力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kili.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:13.90,2:00:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,奇力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kili!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:19.87,2:00:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,奇力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kili!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:21.44,2:00:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,塔瑞尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tauriel!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:23.52,2:00:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,奇力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kili.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:29.72,2:01:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:41.14,2:01:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:20.47,2:07:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,塔瑞尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tauriel!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:15.93,2:12:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,巨鹰来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Eagles are coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:08.13,2:13:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,比尔博\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bilbo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:08.95,2:13:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,别动 别动 躺好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't move. Don't move. Lie still.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:15.55,2:13:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,很高兴你在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm glad you are here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:19.68,2:13:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我希望死前能跟你重修旧好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wish to part from you in friendship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:21.50,2:13:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:22.66,2:13:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你会活得好好的 索林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are not going anywhere, Thorin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:24.80,2:13:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你会活下去的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're going to live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:26.60,2:13:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我要收回\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would take back...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:28.00,2:13:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,在城墙上对你说的话和做的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...my words and my deeds at the Gate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:31.54,2:13:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你做了真正的朋友才会做的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You did what only a true friend would do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:35.68,2:13:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,原谅我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forgive me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:39.16,2:13:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我被贪欲蒙蔽了双眼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was too blind to see it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:43.70,2:13:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我非常抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am so sorry...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:45.88,2:13:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,,把你卷入这些险境\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...that I have led you into such peril.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:49.27,2:13:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我很高兴能跟你有难同当 索林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I'm glad to have shared in your perils, Thorin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:52.66,2:13:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,每一次都是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Each and every one of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:57.25,2:14:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,这远超过任何巴金斯家人所应得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is far more than any Baggins deserves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:05.12,2:14:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,再见了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Farewell...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:06.88,2:14:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,飞贼先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...Master Burglar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:10.04,2:14:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,回去看你的书\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go back to your books.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:13.25,2:14:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,享受你的座椅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And your armchair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:16.92,2:14:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,种你的树\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Plant your trees.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:19.55,2:14:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,看着它们成长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch them grow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:26.40,2:14:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,如果更多的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If more people...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:29.26,2:14:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,珍视家园\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...valued home...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:31.45,2:14:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,胜过黄金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...above gold...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:34.00,2:14:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,那这个世界会更美好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...this world would be a merrier place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:41.32,2:14:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不 不 不 不 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. No, no, no. No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:43.64,2:14:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,索林 索林 我不准你死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thorin. Thorin, don't you dare.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:48.46,2:14:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,索林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thorin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:55.56,2:14:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,索林 索林 坚持住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thorin. Thorin, hold on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:58.64,2:14:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你要挺住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:00.08,2:15:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你看 巨鹰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Eagles...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:01.87,2:15:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,巨鹰 巨鹰来帮忙了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Eagles... The Eagles are here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:04.71,2:15:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,索林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thorin?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:09.03,2:15:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,鹰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Ea...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:06.85,2:16:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能回去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I cannot go back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:10.88,2:16:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你要到哪里去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where will you go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:13.70,2:16:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我还不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do not know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:16.45,2:16:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,去北方吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go north.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:18.64,2:16:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,找到登丹人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find the Dúnedain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:21.77,2:16:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,那里有一个年轻的游侠 你应该见见他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a young Ranger amongst them. You should meet him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:26.56,2:16:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,他的父亲阿拉松是个好人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His father, Arathorn, was a good man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:29.88,2:16:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,他的儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His son...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:31.94,2:16:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,将来也会是个伟人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...might grow to be a great one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:36.92,2:16:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,他叫什么名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is his name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:38.96,2:16:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,别人都叫他神行客\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's known in the wild as Strider.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:42.25,2:16:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,他真实的姓名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His true name...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:44.08,2:16:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你得自己去发现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you must discover for yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:50.40,2:16:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,莱戈拉斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Legolas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:53.36,2:16:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你母亲很爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your mother loved you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:57.45,2:16:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,超越任何人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}More than anyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:00.07,2:17:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,胜过自己的生命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}More than life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:37.36,2:17:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,他们要埋葬他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They want to bury him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:41.32,2:17:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:44.04,2:17:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,如果这就是爱 我宁愿不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If this is love, I do not want it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:50.21,2:17:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,把它从我这收回吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take it from me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:52.68,2:17:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:59.74,2:18:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么会如此令人心碎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why does it hurt so much?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:03.46,2:18:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,因为这是真心的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because it was real.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:13.48,2:22:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,国王殁了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The king is dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:17.19,2:22:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,国王万岁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Long live the king!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:19.87,2:22:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,国王万岁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Long live the king!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:30.81,2:22:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,今晚这里会大设宴席\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is to be a great feast tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:33.14,2:22:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,人们歌功颂德 故事将会流传\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Songs will be sung. Tales will be told.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:37.08,2:22:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,索林·橡木盾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And Thorin Oakenshield...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:39.27,2:22:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,将会成为一个传奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...will pass into legend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:43.12,2:22:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你们肯定会那样称颂他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know that's how you must honor him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:45.06,2:22:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,但对我而言 他从来都不是那样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But to me, he was never that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:47.99,2:22:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,他是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:50.48,2:22:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,对我而言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:22:53.66,2:22:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,他是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...he was...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:23:02.06,2:23:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我看我还是悄悄地离开好了 请替我向其他人告别\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll slip quietly away. Will you tell the others I said goodbye?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:23:05.47,2:23:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以亲自和他们说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can tell them yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:23:23.34,2:23:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,以后你们有谁再从袋底洞路过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If any of you are ever passing Bag End, uh...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:23:31.90,2:23:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,下午茶四点开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...tea is at 4.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:23:34.86,2:23:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,绝对管够\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's plenty of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:23:39.05,2:23:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,随时欢迎你们到来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are welcome anytime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:23:49.73,2:23:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,不用敲门了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't bother knocking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:24:33.50,2:24:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,到了夏尔的边界了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, the borders of the Shire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:24:37.27,2:24:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就在这里分开吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is here I must leave you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:24:42.24,2:24:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,真遗憾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a shame.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:24:46.21,2:24:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢一路上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I quite liked having...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:24:48.02,2:24:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,有巫师在身边陪伴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...a Wizard around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:24:51.14,2:24:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,他们似乎总能带来好运气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seems they bring good luck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:24:53.96,2:24:57.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你不会真以为 你这一路的冒险和逃脱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't really suppose, do you, that all your adventures and escapes...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:24:57.43,2:24:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,仅仅是因为运气好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...were managed by mere luck?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:00.77,2:25:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,魔力指环不能轻易使用 比尔博\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Magic rings should not be used lightly, Bilbo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:04.23,2:25:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,不要当我是傻子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't take me for a fool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:05.56,2:25:08.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你在哥布林的地道里捡到了一枚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you found one in the Goblin tunnels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:08.39,2:25:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,从那时起我就一直盯着你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I've kept my eye on you ever since.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:14.97,2:25:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 谢天谢地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, thank goodness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:21.32,2:25:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,再会了 甘道夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Farewell, Gandalf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:25.79,2:25:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,再会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Farewell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:34.33,2:25:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You, uh...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:35.44,2:25:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你不必担心那个戒指 战斗时它从我的口袋里掉了出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You needn't worry about that ring. Fell out of my pocket during the battle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:39.57,2:25:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,找不到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I lost it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:41.77,2:25:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你是一个品行高尚的人 巴金斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a very fine person, Mr. Baggins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:46.37,2:25:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我非常欣赏你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'm very fond of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:50.22,2:25:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,但毕竟你只是个小人物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you're only quite a little fellow...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:25:53.76,2:25:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,而这世界大得很\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...in a wide world after all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:27.85,2:26:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下 那是我母亲的嫁妆盒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a minute, that's my mother's glory box.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:30.96,2:26:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,那是 我的餐桌椅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that's my dining chair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:33.53,2:26:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 把那个给我放下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah... Put that pouf down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:36.71,2:26:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:38.82,2:26:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你好 比尔博先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, Mr. Bilbo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:41.08,2:26:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你不应该出现在这里的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not supposed to be here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:43.02,2:26:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你什么意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:44.32,2:26:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你已经被认定为死亡了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On account of you being presumed dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:47.36,2:26:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我没死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am not dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:49.08,2:26:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,认定不成立\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Presumed or otherwise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:52.08,2:26:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我不确定这样行不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not sure that's permitted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:54.14,2:26:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,比尔博先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Bilbo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:56.00,2:26:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,还有谁 出价二十一块\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Twenty-one! Any advance on 21?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:26:58.76,2:27:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,二十一块还有谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any advance on 21?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:27:01.00,2:27:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,卖给博尔吉太太了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ha, ha! Sold to Mrs. Bolger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:27:03.77,2:27:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,可以给小胖墩垫脚用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somewhere for Fatty to put his feet on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:27:08.49,2:27:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,这里还有一些工艺品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any bids for this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:27:10.07,2:27:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,纯正的夏尔制造\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Shire-made.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:27:11.58,2:27:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,绝对没有一件是矮人的仿制品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No Dwarvish reproductions here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:27:14.32,2:27:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,停下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:27:15.70,2:27:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,停下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:27:16.53,2:27:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这里有些误会 - 你是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There's been a mistake! - Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:27:19.38,2:27:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你什么意思 问我是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean who am I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:27:20.26,2:27:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你肯定清楚的知道我是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know perfectly well who I am...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:27:21.72,2:27:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,罗贝利亚·塞克维拉·巴金斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...Lobelia Sackville-Baggins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:27:24.31,2:27:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我的家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is my home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:27:25.73,2:27:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,那些是我的勺子 非常感谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And those are my spoons. Thank you very much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:27:28.67,2:27:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这太疯狂了 - 让一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This is most irregular. - Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:27:30.15,2:27:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你失踪已经超过十三个月了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's been more than 13 months since the disappearance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:27:34.11,2:27:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你是真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you are in fact...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:27:35.64,2:27:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,比尔博·巴金斯 并且还没有死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...Bilbo Baggins and undeceased...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:27:39.23,2:27:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你能证明吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...can you prove it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:27:41.02,2:27:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:27:42.58,2:27:45.13,Default,,0,0,0,,一些正式的印有你名字在上面的物件就可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something official with your name on it would suffice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:27:45.13,2:27:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:27:49.88,2:27:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,这是一份雇佣合同 雇用我作为飞…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A contract of employment as a bur...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:27:55.18,2:27:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,别管飞什么的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never mind as what.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:27:57.92,2:27:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,这里 我的签名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There. My signature.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:27:59.52,2:28:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 那么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, well... Uh...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:28:01.90,2:28:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 看起来确实是正规文件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it certainly seems to be in order.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:28:03.64,2:28:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:28:05.28,2:28:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,看来毫无疑问\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seems there can be no doubt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:28:08.18,2:28:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,这个接受你服务的人是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who is this you pledged your service to?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:28:12.24,2:28:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,索林·橡木盾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thorin Oakenshield?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:28:17.18,2:28:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:28:19.29,2:28:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,他是我的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was my friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:30:15.75,2:30:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,不要敲了 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, thank you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:30:17.40,2:30:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不想见任何访客 祝寿者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't want any more visitors, well-wishers...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:30:19.77,2:30:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,或者远亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...or distant relations!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:30:22.40,2:30:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,那如果是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what about...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:30:23.24,2:30:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,非常老的朋友呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...very old friends?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:30:32.94,2:30:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,甘道夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gandalf?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:30:34.12,2:30:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,比尔博·巴金斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bilbo Baggins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:30:35.91,2:30:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我亲爱的甘道夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My dear Gandalf!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:30:37.68,2:30:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,见到你真好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's good to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:30:39.36,2:30:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你都111岁了 谁会信呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One hundred and 11 years old. Who would believe it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:30:47.28,2:30:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,快请 快进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, come in!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:30:49.44,2:30:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎 欢迎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome. Welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
